'''VRChat Feedback''' (or "Canny" - the software's name) is an official website - available at ''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com|feedback.vrchat.com}}'' - used to gather community feedback to influence product decisions and help improve the platform. The feedback might include feature requests, bug reports and ideas for a multitude of supported platforms, websites and other VRChat initiatives.

Users might create posts with their feedback, comment on existing ones, or upvote them. The posts are categorized in boards, each dedicated to a specific platform, feature, release, software, initiative etc. VRChat developers might comment on and track selected posts, labelling them as e.g. "Interested", "In progress" or "Completed", depending on the platform's interests and progress.

== Requirements ==
To create a post, comment, or upvote, users must log in with their VRChat account and have a [[Special:MyLanguage/Trust Rank|trust rank]] of "New User" or higher.

== Boards ==
Boards listed for logged-out visitors on the Feedback site include:

=== General ===

* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests|Feature Requests}}''' - Requests for changes or additions to the VRChat platform.
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports|Bug Reports}}''' - [[Reporting#Reporting a bug|Bugs]] on the VRChat platform.
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon|World/Udon Bugs & Feature Requests}}'''
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30|Avatar Bugs & Feature Requests}}'''
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports|SDK Bug & Feature Requests}}'''
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/localization|Localization}}''' - Localization issues.
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-plus-feature-ideas|VRChat+ Feature Ideas}}''' - Suggesting new features for [[VRC+]].

=== Beta ===

* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta|Open Beta}}''' - Feedback, feature requests, and bug reports for [[Open Beta]] builds and branches.
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/android|Android}}''' - Feedback, feature requests, and bug reports for Android.
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/ios-mobile-beta|iOS}}''' - Feedback, feature requests, and bug reports for iOS.

=== Features ===

* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/creator-economy|Creator Economy}}''' - Feedback and bug reports for [[Creator Economy]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/impostors|Impostors}}''' - Feedback and bug reports for avatar [[Impostors]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-ik-20|VRChat IK 2.0}}''' - Feedback and bug reports for [[Inverse Kinematics]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/persistence|Persistence}}''' - Feedback and bug reports for [[Persistence]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/age-verification|Age Verification Feedback}}''' - Feedback for [[Age Assurance]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace|Avatar Marketplace}}''' - Feedback for [[Avatar Marketplace]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/third-person-view|Third-Person View}}''' - Feedback for [[Third Person View]].

=== Websites ===

* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/website|Website}}''' - Feedback for VRChat websites.
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/merch|Merch Ideas}}''' - Suggesting new items for VRChat to add to their merchandise store.

=== Software ===

* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/creator-companion|Creator Companion}}''' - Bug reports and feature requests for [[VRChat Creator Companion]].
* '''{{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com/example-central|Example Central}}''' - Feedback and bug reports for [[Example Central]] in Unity.

